    "title": "Day1Lab - Paid Clinical Trials",
    "description": "Day1Labs is where patients go to get matched with clinical trials. Whether you are healthy, or have a mental or physical condition, we'll find the right trial for you, and keep you informed of upcoming trials suitable for you in your area.\r\n\r\nNot only will you get access to cutting edge medical treatment, you may also be compensated to participate in the clinical trials you qualify for.",
